# ITT Licensing Framework

## Documentation & LaTeX Sources
All theoretical manuscripts, papers, and text under `papers/`, `mathematics/`, and `research/` are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0).

## Code & Numerical Algorithms
All source code, scripts under `symbolic/`, `numerical/`, and `research/`, and validation workflows are licensed under the MIT License. Numerical JSON and NPZ snapshots under `research/` are licensed under CC-BY-4.0.
